{
  "case": "export-026-grid-successor",
  "clause": "DESIGN R3.3 \u00a714.3 L961; \u00a710.2 L774; \u00a710.2 L801",
  "derivation": "Derived from the JS lot-4 seal (seal.json SHA-256 2182fdfa57e862f50e2c07261dc2864c3e475cd33c249db6d28dd957b76ccddf), case file SHA-256 d1caf668397e28928cd052b93b89c97d7b3945e04b4ed2dcfaddffa7bf6db001, by parity-sync decision PS-06 (DESIGN \u00a79.4 L723: IO object centres on one row line; RH = max(minHeight, max(object.h + label.h) + 2\u00b7padding), A = max(object.h/2), B = max(object.h/2 + label.h), cy = body.y + max(A, (RH + A \u2212 B)/2), object y = cy \u2212 h/2, one roundEven per coordinate): the inputs are the PS-06 layout of layout-009-grid-successor (Task_A y 7008 \u2192 8) and the R of render-022-grid-successor; the PreparedArtifact copies them: renderBinding (layoutDigest, payloadDigest), viewRevision = H({semanticRevision, layoutDigest, themeId, themeDigest, overridesDigest, diStylesDigest, metricsDigest}), the Task_A IR node bounds y 8 and the artifact digest H(ir) of the shared Result/PreparedArtifact report are recomputed; IDs, idMap, entries and capability do not change. The JS seal carries the decided values. Values owned by that seal (harmonization \u00a73; parity sync PS-H19). JS derivation: Complete loss map of the explicitly bound grid successor, counter origin 10: z-last is emitted by export-nested-nodes under the a-first node of its page, after the other nodes, with its preallocated number; the two side stripes are emitted as nodes named Auxiliary without idMap records; the synthetic stripes also carry the when-true semantic-type loss with unavailable source and result coordinates. Fails against: Numbering z-last by emission order, a stripe idMap record, or a fabricated tree pointer for a synthetic loss.",
